Derived material
----------------

The editorial design system of this project — the CSS token layer, the bento grid
primitives, the typographic scale, the scroll regulator, the page index and the
showcase motion module — is adapted from the ArtCraft web experience, with
substantial changes: the components, the content, the data, the colour palette and
the motion parameters are specific to this championship.

    frontend/src/styles/tokens.css          adapted from the ArtCraft token layer
    frontend/src/styles/display.css         adapted from the ArtCraft type scale
    frontend/src/components/bento/          adapted from the ArtCraft bento primitives
    frontend/src/components/PageRuler.astro  adapted from the ArtCraft scroll regulator
    frontend/src/components/PageIndex.astro  adapted from the ArtCraft page index
    frontend/src/scripts/showcase-motion.ts  adapted from the ArtCraft motion module

